# Start Exploration: repeat SWEEP and freshly planned EXECUTE_PATH indefinitely.
# Verify is dormant and disconnected from Exploration.
# Set true to skip the initial TAKEOFF; requires airborne, armed AUTO.LOITER.
# The default false runs TAKEOFF once and requires a disarmed vehicle.
# Cancellation ends the goal; monitor alerts and flight errors abort it.
# Recovery requests LOITER. Send a new goal explicitly to resume Exploration.
bool skip_takeoff
---
bool success
string message
---
# Current Exploration child state or mission lifecycle event.
string state
string message
